    "text": "$\\%$ of $\\mathrm{C}=\\frac{12}{44} \\times \\frac{0.147}{0.2} \\times 100=20.045 \\%$\r\n\r\n$\\%$ of $\\mathrm{H}=\\frac{2}{18} \\times \\frac{0.12}{0.2} \\times 100=6.666 \\%$\r\n\r\n$\\%$ of $\\mathrm{O}=100-(20.045+6.666)=73.29 \\%$",
